Explanation:
Functions used: random.default_rng, rng.random,rng.integers,random.randint
Usage: random.default_rng creates a random generator that can be used in the next steps for random array generation
rng.random generates an array of given shape with elements randomly chosen floating point numbers between 0 and 1
rng.integers generates an array of given shape with elements randomly chosen integers between given limits
random.randint has the same functionality as rng.integers
